{"role":"user","utterance":"Sure, that's fine."}
{"role":"agent","utterance":"Thanks. First, do you hold an active Colorado RN license, or an active multistate compact RN license?"}
{"role":"user","utterance":"Colorado. I've had it about six years."}
{"role":"agent","utterance":"Great. And which certifications do you have right now? BLS and ACLS are the two we require."}
{"role":"user","utterance":"BLS and ACLS, both current, and I've got PALS too."}
{"role":"agent","utterance":"Good to hear, and PALS is a nice extra. Now I'd like to ask about your experience. Tell me about a time you managed an upset patient or family member. What was the situation, and how was it resolved?"}
